        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wim Jonk, Jordi Cruyff, Johan Cruyff, Dennis Bergkamp\n- Organizations: Cruyff Football, Inter Milan, Maccabi Tel Aviv\n- Roles: manager, former footballer\n- Events: Johan Cruyff's death, Inter Milan's 1993 summer acquisitions\n\nFacts:\n- In the summer of 1993, Inter Milan acquired Dutch players Dennis Bergkamp and Wim Jonk after having identified them in the previous winter.\n- Johan Jordi Cruijff, anglicised as Jordi Cruyff, was born on 9 February 1974 and is a Dutch former footballer.\n- Johan Cruyff died on 24 March 2016.\n- Jordi Cruyff is currently the manager of Maccabi Tel Aviv.\n- Wim Jonk and Jordi Cruyff manage Cruyff Football.\n- Wim Jonk and Jordi Cruyff are responsible through Cruyff Football for the worldwide continuation and dissemination of Johan Cruyff's football legacy.",
